# This repo tracks files under scripts/. A global [Ss]cripts exclude
# (~/.config/git/ignore) would otherwise hide new ones from git status.
!scripts/

# Likewise the global venv excludes carry an [Ii]nclude rule, which matches
# main/include/ and would hide a new firmware header (e.g. protocol/plan.h).
!main/include/

# The global excludes also carry a [Ll]ib rule, which would hide the product
# UI's shadcn helper directory. Re-include it so container/web/src/lib is tracked.
!container/web/src/lib/
